/**
 * Predefined secondary action handlers: - task_generation_generate: Task generation field actions - continue_conversation: Continue conversation without triggering generation - adr_content_apply: Apply suggested ADR context section - initiative_content_apply: Apply suggested initiative field edits - task_content_apply: Apply suggested task field edits - next_step: Perform the next step - complete_onboarding: Mark the onboarding experience as complete - coding_prompt_accept: Accept the system\'s prompt code - suggested_action: Surface a suggested action from an agent response - related_entities: Surface related entities from an agent response - plan_gap_continue_revising: Continue revising plan gap discovery - plan_approval_continue_revising: Continue revising plan approval - plan_stage_continue_revising: Continue revising plan stage proposal - plan_service_analyze: Have system analyze plan for services - suggested_agent_action: Pre-canned prompt template to send to a coding agent - sync_recommendation_continue_revising: Continue refining sync recommendations - plan_generation_stage_review_continue_revising: Continue revising local plan-generation proposed stages - plan_generation_stage_review_approve_all: Approve all local plan-generation proposed stages - plan_generation_step_review_continue_revising: Continue revising local plan-generation proposed steps - plan_generation_step_review_approve_all: Approve all local plan-generation proposed steps - plan_generation_journey_map_approve: Approve the JourneyMap and kick off plan creation - plan_generation_journey_map_continue_revising: Continue revising the JourneyMap with user feedback - refine_stage_validation_choice_pick_validation_on: Opt into the post-creation validation pass on the refine-stage validation-choice gate - refine_stage_validation_choice_pick_validation_off: Skip the post-creation validation pass on the refine-stage validation-choice gate - plan_shaping_feature_sync_review_done: Declare the feature-sync review finished and advance to stage proposal without approving any proposal; pending DRAFTs are recorded as dismissed - plan_shaping_feature_sync_review_request_revisions: Request revisions on the feature-sync review gate; revision text is carried by the field element payload 
 * @export
 * @enum {string}
 */

